Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 11:15:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD vim visual selection copying for both terminal panes

Support character, line, and block visual selections in the focused terminal pane and yank the selected text through the terminal clipboard path. The harness coverage exercises right-pane transcript selections and left-pane row selections so the behavior stays tied to the shared TerminalUi render path.
